Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:21.80,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Desenrolla el mapa sin fin...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:24.76,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}...y ve al lugar que no tiene límites.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.89,0:07:29.35,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Iza alto la vela para zarpar...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:32.19,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}...y surcar los vientos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:41.70,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Si tienes determinación, no te des por vencido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:44.87,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}No daré marcha atrás.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.95,0:07:48.62,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Ahuyenta los mares tormentosos con tu risa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:52.96,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Grítalo, a fin de que tu espíritu no se desmorone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:56.05,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Mira, tienes compañeros.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:08:01.84,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}No necesitas hacerte el fuerte.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.97,0:08:05.85,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Incluso si la oscuridad intenta separarnos,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:07.22,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}vamos, afronta la situación.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.31,0:08:08.73,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}No pasa nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:12.44,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Nuestros lazos son los más fuertes y son invencibles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:15.19,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Desenrolla el mapa sin fin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.23,0:08:18.40,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}...y ve al lugar que no tiene límites.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:22.99,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Sé valiente y da ese paso.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.99,0:08:23.95,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}No dejes de soñar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:26.41,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Desenrolla el mapa sin fin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:29.37,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Hemos hecho muchos juramentos a nuestra bandera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.50,0:08:32.25,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Continúa luchando.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:36.84,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}Sé "tú mismo"...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:41.55,Dorimu-tradx,,0,0,0,,{\be2}{\pos(960,1070)}...y así lo conseguirás, no dejes de soñar.
